section(class='newsletter-banner')
	div(class='newsletter-banner__inner')
		div(class='newsletter-banner__card')
			div(class='newsletter-banner__intro')
				span(class='newsletter-banner__icon' aria-hidden='true')
					svg(class='newsletter-banner__icon-svg' width='28' height='28' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none')
						path(d='M4 8l8 5 8-5' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round')
						rect(x='3' y='6' width='18' height='12' rx='2' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8')
						path(d='M9 11h6' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round')
				p(class='newsletter-banner__text') Recibí novedades, guías y consejos para sentirte mejor todos los días.

			div(class='newsletter-banner__form-wrap')
				form(class='newsletter-banner__form' action='#' method='post')
					label(class='newsletter-banner__sr-only' for='newsletterEmail') Tu correo electrónico
					div(class='newsletter-banner__field')
						input(class='newsletter-banner__input' id='newsletterEmail' type='email' name='email' placeholder='Tu correo electrónico' required)
						button(class='newsletter-banner__submit' type='submit') Suscribirme
				p(class='newsletter-banner__note') Nada de spam. Solo información útil para tu bienestar.
